### 2.3 ws-hub.ts — WebSocket Hub

**File:** `DroidGrid Pro/src-server/ws-hub.ts` (new, 93 lines)

WebSocket server with auth grace window:

| Close Code | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| 4400 | Invalid JSON or non-auth first message |
